    <h1>Creative Direction</h1>
    <p class="project-subtitle" style="text-align: center; color: var(--color-muted); margin-bottom: 2rem;">Creative Direction and Brand Strategy: Loyalty, ExtraCare and ExtraCare Plus</p>

    <p class="project-intro">As a Lead Designer and Strategist, my role extended beyond product architecture into defining the visual and creative strategy for CVS Health's flagship loyalty programs, ExtraCare and ExtraCare Plus. I specialized in scaling brand narratives across fragmented touchpoints, ensuring that high-impact marketing initiatives felt seamless, engaging, and unified.</p>

