      <p>Creative direction for this project also included the creation of a graphic style for the following families of "Products":</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Punch cards:</strong> routine creators</li>
        <li><strong>Badges:</strong> affinity builders</li>
      </ul>

      <p>For the punch card family, this meant creating and documenting a series of components that could be expanded upon when growing the program post launch. Where each component could be customized and personalized for a unique customer experience that continued building brand loyalty, and enticed customers to return to CVS.</p>

      <p>As for the badge family, this entailed collaborating directly with the business and the "A&BC" (Analytics and behavioral change) teams to determine which accomplishments would be best suited to highlight during a pilot. After these were identified, we kicked off the process of creating a series of unified graphics, names and taglines that were in line with the broader CVS brand, while keeping a sense of fun for the customer.</p>

